<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">Meitei: Roman Script 1st Translation</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">2 John</para>
  <para style="toc1">JOHN-NA I-ba Anisuba Chithi</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 John</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Jn</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOHN-NA</para>
  <para style="mt2">I-ba Anisuba Chithi</para>
  <para style="imt1">Wahoudok</para>
  <para style="ip">Anisuba John-na i-ba chithi asi Pakhonchatpa John-na Christtana poklaba matung chahi 50 dagi 100 phaobagi manungda i-bani. John masanadi mahakna i-bani haijade adubu ahal lammani haina mahakna masabu haijei. 2 John-da yaoriba machaksing asi John-na i-ba Aphaba paoda yaoriba aduga yamna naknana chatli. Maru oina manariba asi Jisuna henna kanna haiba wahei haibadi eikhoi amaga amaga nungsinagadabani haiba amadi Jisubu nungsiba haibasi mahakki yathang inbaga manahanba asini (1:5-6, John 15:9-10). John-na i-ba Aphaba Pao amadi chithi ahum haibadi 1 John, 2 John amasung 3 John hairibasing asi John-na Ephesus-ta leiringeida i-bani.</para>
  <para style="ip">John-na chithi asi khandokpiraba nupi amadi nupi adugi machasing adu panduna i-ri. Mahakna hairiba nupi asi singlup amabu oiramba yai. Chithi asi singluppu thougatnaba amadi aranba tambiba ojasinggi maramda cheksin wa oina i-bani.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaopham Takpa</para>
  <para style="io1">1. John-na chithi asi kanada i-bano takpa amadi chithi phanggadabasing adu khurumjaraga houdok-i <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Mathangda mahakna singluppu pukning thougatli amadi khwaidagi chaoba yathang adubu makhoida ningsinghalli <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:4-6">1:4-6</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Lanna tambiba ojasingda cheksin wa haiba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:7-11">1:7-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. John-na leiriba singlup adugi thajabasingna khurumjarakpa adubu makhoida tamlaga mahakna chithi asi loisilli <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:12-13">1:12-13</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1"/>Ahan laman ama oiraba eingondagini---</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2JN 1:1">Eina achumbada nungsijaba amadi Tengban Mapuna khandokpiraba ibemma amasung mahakki machasinggi maphamdani. Eita nattaduna achumba adubu khangba mi pumnamaknasu nakhoibu nungsijei, <verse eid="2JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2"/>eikhoida leiba amasung eikhoiga matam pumnamakta leiminnagadaba achumba adugi maramdani.<verse eid="2JN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3"/>Ipa Ibungo Tengban Mapudagi amasung Ipa adugi Machanupa Jisu Christtadagi thoujal, chanbiba amasung ingthaba adu achumba amasung nungsibada eikhoida loinabiba oisanu.<verse eid="2JN 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Achumba amasung nungsiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4"/>Ipadagi eikhoina yathang phanglabagumna, nahakki nachasinggi marakta kharana achumbada chatli haiba tabada eibu yamna haraohalli. <verse eid="2JN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Jn 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:12">15:12</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref></char></note>Ibemma, houjik eina nangonda anouba yathang ama i-ba natte adubu eikhoina ahoubadagi eikhoina taraba aduni. Eikhoi amaga amaga nungsinanaba eina nonjari. <verse eid="2JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6"/>Eikhoina mahakki yathangsing inna chatpa haibasi nungsibani. Nakhoina ahoubadagi tarabagumna mahakki yathangdi nakhoina nungsibada chatpa aduni.<verse eid="2JN 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7"/>Jisu Christtana hakchang oina lakle haiba yadaba minamba kaya ama taibangpanda thokkhre, maram asina eina masi haibani. Adugumba misak adudi minamba amasung Christtabu Yeknaba aduni. <verse eid="2JN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8"/>Eikhoina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ariba lairik kharada </char><char style="fqa">Nakhoina</char> haina i-ri</note> nomjakhiba adu manghandaba, adubu nakhoina mapung phana mana phangnaba nakhoi cheksillu.<verse eid="2JN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9"/>Kanagumbana Christtagi tambiba adudagi leithokpa amadi tambiba aduda lengdana leitaba mahak aduna Tengban Mapubu phangde; tambiba aduda lengdana leiba mahak aduna Mapa amasung Machanupa animak phangle. <verse eid="2JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10"/>Kanagumbana nakhoida laklaga tambiba asi puraktrabadi, mahakpu nayumda lousin-ganu amasung taram taramna touganu. “Nangonda ingthaba oisanu” haiba phaoba haiganu. <verse eid="2JN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11"/>Kanagumbana makhoibu taram taramna oklabadi mahakna makhoigi phattaba thabak aduda mahaksu yaorabani.<verse eid="2JN 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aroiba wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12"/>Eina nakhoida igadaba yamna leiri adubu eina che amasung mukna i-ba pamdre. Madugi mahutta eikhoigi haraoba mapung phanaba eina nakhoigi nanakta laktuna nakhoiga maiga maiga unaduna wari sananabagi asa touri.<verse eid="2JN 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13"/>Tengban Mapuna khandokpirabi nahakki nanaonupigi machasingna nahakpu khurumjei.<verse eid="2JN 1:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1"/>
</usx>
